\fs22 Game Night Access Adapter\par
\par
This installer copies the desktop app, creates a Python virtual environment, and adds Start Menu and desktop shortcuts.\par
\par
If Python 3 is missing, setup installs it automatically (winget or python.org). Put adb (Android platform-tools) on PATH before you use phone tilt.\par
\par
The app maps phone sensors to keyboard keys for the focused game window.\par
